{"id":"iglesia","lemma":"iglesia","pos":"noun","rank":681,"glosses":["church"],"ipa":"/iˈɡlesja/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"iglesias"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/40/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-iglesia.wav","examples":[{"text":"Esa es una iglesia.","en":"That's a church.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/78094","words":[{"g":"that","l":"ese"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Aquí solía haber una iglesia.","en":"There used to be a church here.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/770104","words":[{"g":"here"},{"g":"to be accustomed to…","l":"soler"},{"g":"to have"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"¿Cuántos años tiene esa iglesia?","en":"How old is that church?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/461821","words":[{"g":"how much","l":"cuánto"},{"g":"year","l":"año"},{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"that","l":"ese"},null]},{"text":"La vi en la iglesia.","en":"I met her at the church.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/77403","words":[{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"to see, to spot","l":"ver"},{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"the / her"},null]},{"text":"Voy a la iglesia en coche.","en":"I go to church by car.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/453312","words":[{"g":"to go","l":"ir"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"car, automobile"}]}]}